{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_57603","headline":"衆仙步虚词五首 四 · 无名氏","name":"衆仙步虚词五首 四","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"吉光腾紫气，霄路逸丹天。\n蟠扬香风转，盖动超浮烟。\n道中还复道，玄中已复玄。\n真光不识际，大道竟无形。\n法轮常自转，希音不可听。\n空闲待三宝，虚中闻洞经。\n七变游魂反，万气驻颓龄。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"无名氏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_57603.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_57603","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}